nnement, la résidence MÉRIDIEN 29 s'impose comme une opportunité idéale pour vivre ou investir entre Patte d'oie et Saint-Cyprien à Toulouse !","addr":"29, BOULEVARD JEAN BRUNHES","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjIxOGMyODkyOGE2NTcxMWEwNjU3OTM0NTVkZmVlN2RmZDdhZTgxYjgiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI0MTU5NDE2YjQzMmRmOTZkOGZkYjlhZDJjMGExMDQyYyJ9?signature=ce728f7d95c7cf8c229b43fba6b1085890dac2a5f1e0c73dfeb08a768bdba0a2","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjI3ZGFmZDIxOGFkNGFlMjk3N2QxODc5ZDRlMjYxNzM0OGE5ZTJiYjEiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIwMjlmNzY0MDlhOGFmNTA3Njk2NmQ4MjIwZDRhN2VmMyJ9?signature=d9b9037392cf66b140bbbc6fb4078ddfd908b8ca4ab57b00ca26921a87478ec4","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImQ0MjhmNzRjZjMzMjVlNjFlM2RjNWE4YzFmNmI4MjE1ZmJlOGRlN2YiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJhNThkMjNkZjkyMThjZjMzNjMxODcxZjhlMzA0MjZlMyJ9?signature=7b29b3ca01bed9bfa25373114e37f53dc929ad5a535af2065221ba1712e49438"],"yt":[],"vr":[],"logo":"https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InZpbmNpIiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo4NSwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo4NSwiZml0IjoiY292ZXIifX0sImZpbGVIYXNoIjoiOTEyMDc5ZmVhMjZiZTViNmQ2YTBiOTI1NzJlYWJiMGMifQ==?signature=efa11a6b62f11d98a1f129a16063f9a32b1d60cab08f60da1ce40247b2b60072","zone":"A","lots":[{"ty":"T2","na":"Appartement","s":40.0,"f":"1","ex":["O"],"ter":5.72,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":239900.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"T2","na":"Appartement","s":40.0,"f":"2","ex":["O"],"ter":5.72,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":249900.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"T2","na":"Appartement","s":40.0,"f":"2","ex":["O"],"ter":5.72,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":2